        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-20T18:40:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's talk movies, because I'm in that mood. Oscar predictions?</p><ul>\n<li>Writing (Original): Nightcrawler</li>\n<li>Writing (Adapted): The Theory of Everything</li>\n<li>Visual Effects: Interstellar&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Sound Mixing: Whiplash</li>\n<li>Sound Editing: Interstellar</li>\n<li>Production Design: Grand Budapest</li>\n<li>Music (Song):&nbsp;<em>Glory</em> from Selma</li>\n<li>Music (Score): Imitation Game</li>\n<li>Makeup: Foxcatcher</li>\n<li>Film Editing: Whiplash</li>\n<li>Directing: Boyhood</li>\n<li>Costume Design: Inherent Vice</li>\n<li>Cinematography: (Without a doubt, it's...) Birdman</li>\n<li>Best Animated Feature: Boxtrolls</li>\n<li>Best Supporting Actress: Emma Stone, Birdman</li>\n<li>Best Supporting Actor: J.K. Simmons, Whiplash</li>\n<li>Best Actress: Rosamund Pike, Gone Girl</li>\n<li>Best Actor: Steve Carell, Foxcatcher</li>\n<li>Best Picture: Birdman</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And damn the person who nominated&nbsp;<em>American Sniper</em> for best picture instead of&nbsp;<em>Nightcrawler</em>! What a mistake!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:28.021Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
