        "raw": "<p>Let&#39;s talk movies, because I&#39;m in that mood. Oscar predictions?</p><ul><li>Writing (Original): Nightcrawler</li><li>Writing (Adapted): The Theory of Everything</li><li>Visual Effects: Interstellar&nbsp;</li><li>Sound Mixing: Whiplash</li><li>Sound Editing: Interstellar</li><li>Production Design: Grand Budapest</li><li>Music (Song):&nbsp;<em>Glory</em> from Selma</li><li>Music (Score): Imitation Game</li><li>Makeup: Foxcatcher</li><li>Film Editing: Whiplash</li><li>Directing: Boyhood</li><li>Costume Design: Inherent Vice</li><li>Cinematography: (Without a doubt, it&#39;s...) Birdman</li><li>Best Animated Feature: Boxtrolls</li><li>Best Supporting Actress: Emma Stone, Birdman</li><li>Best Supporting Actor: J.K. Simmons, Whiplash</li><li>Best Actress: Rosamund Pike, Gone Girl</li><li>Best Actor: Steve Carell, Foxcatcher</li><li>Best Picture: Birdman</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And damn the person who nominated&nbsp;<em>American Sniper</em> for best picture instead of&nbsp;<em>Nightcrawler</em>! What a mistake!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
